{"id":"n32575-6-9","stage":2,"title":"꺾다 · 调转","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32575-6-9-1","ko":"대전으로 가려면 어디에서 방향을 돌려야 하지?","zh":"去大田的话，要在哪里转弯呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대전으로","meaning":"大田","explanation":"대전：大田；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"대전으로","audio":"/audio/69c30b0e535c2f71756b.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대전으로","audio":"/audio/69c30b0e535c2f71756b.mp3"}},{"text":"가려면","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가려면","audio":"/audio/fde17e82c40c3f9f5bb6.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에서","audio":"/audio/b7f2498da0de7d9f1c85.mp3"}},{"text":"방향을","meaning":"方向","explanation":"방향：方向；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"방향","audio":"/audio/d7895d7647666fe00cec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65533","senseId":"1","lemma":"방향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방향을","audio":"/audio/91830c90d41d2b76277d.mp3"}},{"text":"돌려야","meaning":"转，掉转，扭转","explanation":"돌리다：转，掉转，扭转；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"돌리다","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71457","senseId":"10","lemma":"돌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌려야","audio":"/audio/40d2f7ee4e7235bb6759.mp3"}},{"text":"하지?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origi